member = survivor type (hinge reading y, hinge lap k, cover lap j) from v3_passtype_census_v1.out;
anchor (rho_4,1) = reading idx 3 lap 1; window u_y in (7/(8j+1), 33/((8k-1)*7)); front rho_4 in (7, 5841/833);
region rho_6 > 17 strict, rho_7 >= 25.  B caps all readings.
SCOPE: y=6 members search the type's EXACT rho_7 range [25, (8j+1)/7) (B = (8j+1)/7 auto).
       y in {4,5} members close the type only for rho_7 <= 49 (B = 49; the type pins rho_y's window but
       leaves rho_7 region-bounded, so the census covers rho_7 in [25, 49] only).
cover_words = words reaching a 7-covering exit (nonzero would be a carve of W_0 on the V3 region).
RESULT: cover_words = 0 for ALL 23 members.  NO CARVE OF W_0 ON THE V3 REGION at the stated scopes.

